# 📝 Task Management API

**TEST THE API HERE**
https://taskmanagementapiproject-production.up.railway.app/docs


A RESTful API built with **FastAPI** and **PostgreSQL** for managing personal tasks with user authentication And role based authentication.

user/all_users path is open for everyone to test the project 
To test Role Based Authentication
To check how Respose Schema is working

---


## 🚀 Features

- User registration and login with JWT authentication
- Admin registration and login with JWT authentication
- Secure password hashing using Argon2
- Full CRUD operations for tasks
- Each user can only access their own tasks
- Admin can see everyone's task and make changes in them
- Database migrations with Alembic
- Input validation with Pydantic
- Response Model for secutiry

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Python 3.10+ | Core language |
| FastAPI | Web framework |
| PostgreSQL | Database |
| SQLAlchemy | ORM |
| Alembic | Database migrations |
| JWT (PyJWT) | Authentication |
| Argon2 (pwdlib) | Password hashing |
| Pydantic | Data validation |
| Uvicorn | ASGI server |

